  <prompt>Make the binding text say what the owner decided (D8) and give the operator one document for the package's identity, first import and upgrade.</prompt>

  <goal>
    ADR-027 §3 (concise + full) states: customer environments receive SpaarkeMaster MANAGED by default and UNMANAGED only on
    explicit instruction recorded on the run and the registry row; dev (the authoring environment) stays unmanaged. One
    runbook describes the package (t218-plan.md design 1-7), who imports it (IAM), the first import, the upgrade, and the
    release steps; every doc that says otherwise points to it.
  </goal>

  <context>
